<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Italian first division</p>
<p>soccer matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Bologna 1 (Paramatti 54th minute) Piacenza 1 (Tentoni 90).</p>
<p>Halftime 0-0. Attendance: 20,000</p>
<p>Cagliari 1 (Pancaro 10 - penalty) Reggiana 1 (Hatz 49). 1-0.</p>
<p>12,000</p>
<p>Fiorentina 4 (Batistuta 49, Rui Costa 62, Oliveira 87, Rocco 90</p>
<p>- own-goal) Perugia 1 (Gautieri 56). 0-0. 36,000</p>
<p>Milan 2 (Savicevic 54, Eranio 67) Udinese 1 (Stroppa 56). 0-0.</p>
<p>45,000</p>
<p>Napoli 1 (Milanese 90) Verona 0. 0-0. 50,000</p>
<p>Parma 0 Atalanta 0. 20,000</p>
<p>Sampdoria 0 Juventus 1 (Ferrara 33). 0-1. 47,000</p>
<p>Vicenza 1 (Maini 18) Inter 1 (Djorkaeff 63 - penalty). 1-0.</p>
<p>19,000</p>
<p>Lazio 0 Roma 0. 65,000</p>
